'''''Noccaea perfoliata''''' is a species of [[flowering plant]] in the family [[Brassicaceae]].<ref>{{Cite web|title=Thlaspi perfoliatum L. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/594106|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Thlaspi perfoliatum (Perfoliate Penny Cress) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/CRUC/Thlaspi_perfoliatum.php |access-date=2022-03-07 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us}}</ref> It is an [[annual plant|annual]] native to southern, central, and southeastern Europe, North Africa, and western and central Asia from the eastern Mediterranean to the Altai, Xinjiang, and Pakistan.<ref name = powo/>

